{
  "title": "Chair-Shaped MnII2LnIII4 (Ln = Gd, Tb, Dy, Ho) Heterometallic Complexes Assembled from a Tricompartmental Aminobenzohydrazide Ligand",
  "doi": "10.1021/cg501640y",
